1
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:45,440
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,016 --> 00:00:48,864
=Episode 12=

3
00:01:12,599 --> 00:01:13,280
Xingyao!

4
00:01:26,879 --> 00:01:27,519
What are you doing?

5
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,760
It's just calming incense.

6
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:37,159
Is this how you usually treat Wangshu?

7
00:01:37,719 --> 00:01:38,400
What do you mean?

8
00:01:39,879 --> 00:01:40,719
What are you saying?

9
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:42,599
I'm sorry, Wangshu.

10
00:01:43,959 --> 00:01:45,400
I should have noticed

11
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,000
and realized it sooner,

12
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,439
and told you to run.

13
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:52,079
Is this what you meant by helping him?

14
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,120
No.

15
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,519
Because this

16
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,920
is for me.

17
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,519
It's all my fault.

18
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,560
Wangshu.

19
00:02:00,879 --> 00:02:01,920
That's not true, Xingyao.

20
00:02:13,319 --> 00:02:14,159
Lizhi, stay back.

21
00:02:16,719 --> 00:02:17,719
I'm grateful

22
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:19,360
that you saved Wangshu,

23
00:02:20,159 --> 00:02:22,159
and healed my legs.

24
00:02:23,199 --> 00:02:25,680
But gratitude isn't love,

25
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,599
nor is it a debt!

26
00:02:27,159 --> 00:02:27,960
For a century,

27
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:30,240
brides have been sacrificed
year after year.

28
00:02:30,759 --> 00:02:33,280
Were there others like her before?

29
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:36,159
Soon,

30
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,599
will she

31
00:02:37,599 --> 00:02:39,439
become the next sacrifice?

32
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:41,879
What do you mean?

33
00:02:43,319 --> 00:02:43,879
Lizhi.

34
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:47,800
Stay back.

35
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,560
Show her the world?

36
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:53,960
Keep her safe and sound?

37
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,759
Did you ever bother to ask

38
00:02:56,759 --> 00:02:58,159
if that's what she wanted?

39
00:02:59,039 --> 00:02:59,719
Xingyao.

40
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:02,759
That isn't love.

41
00:03:03,319 --> 00:03:05,879
That's the instinctive terror
of a mortal facing supreme power,

42
00:03:05,879 --> 00:03:08,879
powerless over her own life and death.

43
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:11,479
Besides, before long,

44
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:12,360
you'll be gone.

45
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,800
If you cared about her even a little,

46
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,719
would it truly have to be her?

47
00:03:17,039 --> 00:03:18,759
Or are you no different from the likes

48
00:03:18,759 --> 00:03:20,159
of Zhu Heng and Yue Qiyang,

49
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:21,599
merely using Wangshu

50
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:23,400
to solve your own troubles?

51
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:24,448
Xingyao!

52
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,520
Don't touch her.

53
00:03:30,479 --> 00:03:31,319
Wangshu...

54
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:41,719
Don't...

55
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,280
Everything she said

56
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,000
is what you think,

57
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:46,599
Is it?

58
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:50,759
Is it?

59
00:03:53,599 --> 00:03:55,319
Lizhi, I gave you my word.

60
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:56,879
I won't break our promise,

61
00:03:56,879 --> 00:03:57,960
and I won't leave you.

62
00:03:59,039 --> 00:04:01,080
But I will never let you hurt Xingyao.

63
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:03,776
♪Pear blossoms fall,
scattering old grievances♪

64
00:04:04,224 --> 00:04:07,840
♪Hidden thoughts grow fierce
in the silence♪

65
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:09,960
Don't!

66
00:04:11,072 --> 00:04:14,304
♪Leaving only longing behind♪

67
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:18,304
♪Bound together by love's dark spell♪

68
00:04:18,368 --> 00:04:21,248
♪I draw closer to you despite the pain♪

69
00:04:21,344 --> 00:04:27,904
♪Could this illusion of sweetness
last a little longer?♪

70
00:04:28,128 --> 00:04:34,816
♪Letting you cast the dream into flames
to end it all♪

71
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,639
Lizhi, you...

72
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,632
♪That cruel deceit♪

73
00:04:41,728 --> 00:04:46,144
♪Let me crave one last time♪

74
00:04:46,144 --> 00:04:48,672
♪The gentle warmth in your eyes♪

75
00:04:48,672 --> 00:04:51,808
♪How tender was our final kiss♪

76
00:04:51,808 --> 00:04:55,008
♪May we never meet in the next life♪

77
00:05:07,264 --> 00:05:10,240
♪Bleak rain grazes my fingertips♪

78
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,936
♪Falling into the abyss♪

79
00:05:14,208 --> 00:05:17,056
♪Karma weaves a fateful tribulation♪

80
00:05:17,056 --> 00:05:19,296
♪Writing our farewell♪

81
00:05:20,192 --> 00:05:23,200
♪Red candles flicker
as I fall once more♪

82
00:05:23,584 --> 00:05:27,392
♪Holding your face closer still♪

83
00:05:27,392 --> 00:05:30,272
♪I'd gladly drink poison
to quench this thirst♪

84
00:05:30,272 --> 00:05:33,728
♪A foolish dream left unfulfilled♪

85
00:05:34,519 --> 00:05:36,279
(Show her the world?)

86
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,920
(Keep her safe and sound?)

87
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:41,480
(Did you ever bother to ask)

88
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,720
(if that's what she wanted?)

89
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,720
(Besides, before long,)

90
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,000
(you'll be gone.)

91
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:50,120
Sorry to keep you waiting.

92
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:50,800
You're finally here.

93
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,399
Let's go.

94
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,519
You must be freezing.

95
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:53,879
Not at all.

96
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,032
Let's go.

97
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,960
♪That cruel deceit♪

98
00:06:01,408 --> 00:06:05,440
♪Let me crave one last time♪

99
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:07,904
♪The gentle warmth in your eyes♪

100
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,519
(Desperate in the moment,)

101
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,600
(how could I have hurt him like that?)

102
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:15,160
(Where would he go?)

103
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,879
(He doesn't know mortal ways,)

104
00:06:18,199 --> 00:06:19,480
(has no money,)

105
00:06:20,399 --> 00:06:21,439
(and he's still wounded.)

106
00:06:22,048 --> 00:06:24,320
♪You are my desperate obsession♪

107
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:28,320
♪A riddle without an answer
in this life♪

108
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,279
Let's go.

109
00:06:43,759 --> 00:06:44,399
Try this.

110
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:46,480
I cooked all the dishes I know.

111
00:06:46,959 --> 00:06:48,399
Let's see what our Loong Lord

112
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:50,160
feels like having today.

113
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:53,879
This one?

114
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:58,120
This one?

115
00:06:59,959 --> 00:07:00,959
This one's delicious too.

116
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:11,000
I'm sorry.

117
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:13,759
I shouldn't have reacted that way.

118
00:07:15,759 --> 00:07:16,759
I hurt you.

119
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,360
You're afraid of me.

120
00:07:21,879 --> 00:07:22,839
(I want to say yes.)

121
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:23,920
(I fear him.)

122
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,079
(I overreacted because I thought)

123
00:07:26,079 --> 00:07:26,800
(he'd hurt Xingyao.)

124
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,040
(But I was wrong.)

125
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,560
(He even got hurt because of it.)

126
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,360
(If he hadn't brought it up,)

127
00:07:33,879 --> 00:07:35,240
(I wouldn't have even realized)

128
00:07:35,959 --> 00:07:36,800
(that deep down,)

129
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:40,279
(I no longer want Lizhi to leave.)

130
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,959
(Yet he has to return after all.)

131
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:45,984
I don't.

132
00:07:46,959 --> 00:07:47,839
If you fear me,

133
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,399
or feel upset,

134
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:51,759
you can scold me.

135
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:53,879
What are you saying?

136
00:07:55,279 --> 00:07:56,480
Why would I ever scold you?

137
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,160
Your Li Fire raged out of control

138
00:07:59,519 --> 00:08:00,800
only because I was injured.

139
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,399
Don't worry.

140
00:08:04,079 --> 00:08:05,560
I'll be very careful from now on,

141
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:08,399
and keep myself out of harm's way.

142
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:10,360
I'll stay safe and sound

143
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:11,759
until...

144
00:08:13,319 --> 00:08:14,120
Until you leave.

145
00:08:17,079 --> 00:08:18,000
You want me to leave?

146
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:21,079
I... I don't.

147
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,279
True.

148
00:08:29,519 --> 00:08:31,040
I didn't mean to come to Loong Abyss,

149
00:08:36,639 --> 00:08:37,759
but I know how well

150
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:40,399
you've treated me.

151
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,120
I know it all.

152
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:43,879
Lizhi,

153
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:47,320
I wouldn't take other's fault out
on you.

154
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,559
But I truly hurt you,

155
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,440
and Xingyao.

156
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:54,600
And I really lost control

157
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,120
because of the Li Fire.

158
00:08:58,799 --> 00:09:00,039
What if I lose control again?

159
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,600
Can't I help you?

160
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,519
I'll keep helping you

161
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,240
until

162
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,279
you safely return home.

163
00:09:32,256 --> 00:09:35,280
♪Letting the longing in your eyes♪

164
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:37,488
♪Take root after drowning♪

165
00:09:37,856 --> 00:09:43,456
♪Like a silent, unfeeling,
restrained kiss♪

166
00:09:43,456 --> 00:09:49,088
♪Step by step, inch by inch,
tracing your silhouette♪

167
00:09:49,088 --> 00:09:54,678
♪A rouge-tinted letter
brings a distant lover close♪

168
00:09:54,678 --> 00:10:00,342
♪Torn apart by time,
regrets still intertwine♪

169
00:10:00,342 --> 00:10:05,975
♪We hope to meet, but won't confess♪

170
00:10:05,975 --> 00:10:11,596
♪You're the one I wish to hold
through every page and scene♪

171
00:10:11,810 --> 00:10:20,980
♪A single tear
burns love and hate to ashes♪

172
00:10:21,472 --> 00:10:24,480
♪Letting the longing in your eyes♪

173
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:26,592
♪Take root after drowning♪

174
00:10:27,232 --> 00:10:32,832
♪Like a silent, unfeeling,
restrained kiss♪

175
00:10:32,832 --> 00:10:36,672
♪Step by step, inch by inch,
tracing your silhouette♪

176
00:10:43,159 --> 00:10:43,879
Lizhi...

177
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,159
Lizhi?

178
00:10:50,799 --> 00:10:51,360
Lizhi?

179
00:10:53,759 --> 00:10:54,320
Lizhi?

180
00:10:57,759 --> 00:10:58,320
Lizhi?

181
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:01,639
Wangshu.

182
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,000
Wangshu.

183
00:11:05,559 --> 00:11:06,399
You'll catch a cold.

184
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:07,759
Where's Lizhi?

185
00:11:08,639 --> 00:11:09,919
Did he go out again?

186
00:11:11,919 --> 00:11:12,519
He said

187
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:16,159
he went back.

188
00:11:29,888 --> 00:11:34,208
(Lanyuan, Flood Loong)

189
00:11:41,279 --> 00:11:42,759
Mortal trinkets,

190
00:11:43,399 --> 00:11:44,679
utterly vulgar.

191
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:47,919
My Lord.

192
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,279
She broke her promise

193
00:11:53,799 --> 00:11:55,039
and let you return alone!

194
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,519
I warned you long ago.

195
00:11:56,919 --> 00:11:58,159
Humans are treacherous,

196
00:11:58,519 --> 00:11:59,759
I will bring her here.

197
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:02,519
Did the loong clan

198
00:12:03,879 --> 00:12:05,519
ask you to arrange the bride sacrifice?

199
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:06,480
Did they?

200
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:13,000
How could I arrange such a thing?

201
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,519
This ridiculous ritual

202
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:18,000
of sending a girl to die each year

203
00:12:18,399 --> 00:12:19,919
was concocted centuries ago

204
00:12:20,279 --> 00:12:22,919
by mortals themselves!

205
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,360
They feared the Loong Lord,

206
00:12:25,879 --> 00:12:28,440
so they devised this delusion,

207
00:12:28,799 --> 00:12:31,440
believing it would appease divine wrath.

208
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,120
How is this any concern
of the loong clan?

209
00:12:36,679 --> 00:12:38,240
It was wrong from the very beginning.

210
00:12:39,559 --> 00:12:41,159
Mortals fabricated this whole charade

211
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:44,000
and forced it all onto Wangshu.

212
00:12:44,799 --> 00:12:45,799
From the very beginning,

213
00:12:46,679 --> 00:12:48,200
she was the most innocent sacrifice

214
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,200
in this scheme.

215
00:12:50,679 --> 00:12:52,480
My Lord, you...

216
00:12:53,399 --> 00:12:54,639
You only came back for this?

217
00:12:55,159 --> 00:12:58,039
But... But without anyone
to calm your Li Fire...

218
00:13:02,519 --> 00:13:03,039
No,

219
00:13:03,919 --> 00:13:04,519
I'll go find her.

220
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:07,639
Don't you dare!

221
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:10,528
My Lord!

222
00:13:10,879 --> 00:13:11,480
My Lord!

223
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:12,919
My Lord!

224
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:29,799
Xingyao,

225
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,159
come out. Stop hiding.

226
00:13:45,519 --> 00:13:46,320
Did you forget?

227
00:13:46,679 --> 00:13:47,720
Mother taught me

228
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,879
how to make the sleeping brew first.

229
00:13:56,519 --> 00:13:57,320
Wangshu,

230
00:13:58,159 --> 00:13:59,879
the Yue family won't let it go.

231
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,200
You feared they'd harm us

232
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:03,320
asking me to go now,

233
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:05,000
but you're staying behind.

234
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,120
Are you waiting for him?

235
00:14:09,279 --> 00:14:10,840
Do you blame me for meddling

236
00:14:11,159 --> 00:14:11,679
that day

237
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,679
and upsetting the Loong Lord?

238
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,440
Silly girl.

239
00:14:16,759 --> 00:14:18,000
It has nothing to do with you.

240
00:14:18,159 --> 00:14:20,159
I brought him up from the Loong Abyss,

241
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:22,840
and I promised to return with him.

242
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:24,159
If he comes back

243
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,240
and finds me gone,

244
00:14:25,559 --> 00:14:27,120
I'll be the one breaking my word.

245
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:34,240
If time could turn back

246
00:14:34,919 --> 00:14:36,159
to the day of the ritual,

247
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:38,960
knowing what comes next

248
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:40,360
and how to get away,

249
00:14:41,039 --> 00:14:41,919
would you still run?

250
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:44,759
(Do you know)

251
00:14:46,879 --> 00:14:48,279
I'm in far more pain than you?

252
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:55,519
Beg me.

253
00:14:58,840 --> 00:14:59,639
Run?

254
00:15:01,519 --> 00:15:02,480
I'd still run.

255
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:05,399
I would do everything I could

256
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:08,039
to escape being the Loong Consort,

257
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:10,519
and escape my fate as a sacrifice.

258
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,000
But...

259
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,440
I suppose

260
00:15:29,159 --> 00:15:30,360
I'd still want to meet him.

261
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:36,879
I want to walk up to him

262
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:39,120
on my own,

263
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,120
step by step,

264
00:15:41,559 --> 00:15:42,840
not like a gift

265
00:15:43,639 --> 00:15:45,240
bound and thrown at his feet.

266
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:49,960
All right,

267
00:15:50,159 --> 00:15:51,399
enough about me.

268
00:15:52,279 --> 00:15:53,480
I want you to leave first

269
00:15:53,759 --> 00:15:56,120
because things are different now.

270
00:15:56,399 --> 00:15:58,320
It's too dangerous for you here.

271
00:16:01,279 --> 00:16:02,600
I know what you're going to do.

272
00:16:05,279 --> 00:16:06,039
I'll stay with you.

273
00:16:17,312 --> 00:16:21,887
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

274
00:16:22,662 --> 00:16:27,159
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

275
00:16:30,398 --> 00:16:35,520
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

276
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:38,859
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

277
00:16:38,859 --> 00:16:40,223
♪Refusing to forget♪

278
00:16:43,889 --> 00:16:48,666
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

279
00:16:49,217 --> 00:16:51,007
♪He cannot learn them♪

280
00:16:51,007 --> 00:16:54,142
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

281
00:16:57,294 --> 00:16:59,618
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

282
00:16:59,618 --> 00:17:01,981
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

283
00:17:02,559 --> 00:17:05,223
♪Waiting for snow and wind
